  "releaseNotes": "v5.8.35 - on SpawnDev.ILGPU 5.4.54. Browser: a session created from an OPFS-backed stream (ModelHub) reads it through multi-MB windows, weights still JS to GPU (MobileNetV2 create 276-327 to 109-152 ms; in a real page, Bones: 391 to 235 ms first visit, 443 to 279 ms return visit). ShaderCacheStore: the stored shaders import while the model parses instead of before it, and a page stores its shaders about 300 ms after its first run, so a tab closed soon after keeps them.",
